{"chars": "Growing from the moss was a little cluster of tiny bulbs, green blushed with purple, each shaped like a little cone and no bigger than the tip of Mrs. Claus's thumb. Their leaves had barely begun to grow. But rising from them, on short stems, were flowers, and they were surprisingly big for such a small plant, each one almost as wide as the palm of Mrs. Claus's hand. Their five narrow, pointed petals were the palest pinkish-purple, spreading out like a star. In the middle was a big white lip, rolled into a tube at the back, with a frilly front edge. The lip was sprinkled with purple and golden-brown spots, as if someone had dotted it with a tiny paintbrush, and right in its center glowed a patch of sunny yellow, lined with rows of tiny soft hairs, like the fuzz on a peach.", "start": [0.25, 0.25, 0.25, 0.25, 0.25, 0.25, 0.25, 0.625, 0.625, 0.625, 0.625, 0.625, 0.787, 0.787, 0.787, 0.787, 0.875, 0.875, 0.875, 0.875, 0.875, 1.462, 1.462, 1.462, 1.462, 1.613, 1.613, 1.663, 1.663, 1.663, 1.663, 1.663, 1.663, 1.663, 1.9, 1.9, 1.9, 1.9, 1.9, 1.9, 1.9, 1.9, 2.275, 2.275, 2.275, 2.4, 2.4, 2.4, 2.4, 2.4, 2.75, 2.75, 2.75, 2.75, 2.75, 2.75, 3.475, 3.587, 3.587, 3.587, 3.587, 3.587, 3.587, 3.95, 3.95, 3.95, 3.95, 3.95, 3.95, 3.95, 3.95, 4.287, 4.287, 4.287, 4.287, 4.287, 4.463, 4.463, 4.463, 4.463, 4.463, 4.463, 4.463, 5.075, 5.175, 5.175, 5.175, 5.175, 5.175, 5.412, 5.412, 5.412, 5.412, 5.412, 5.412, 5.412, 5.713, 5.713, 5.713, 5.713, 5.713, 5.862, 5.862, 5.912, 5.912, 5.912, 5.912, 5.912, 5.912, 5.912, 6.213, 6.213, 6.213, 6.213, 6.213, 6.912, 6.912, 6.912, 6.912, 7.037, 7.037, 7.037, 7.2, 7.2, 7.2, 7.2, 7.2, 7.2, 7.2, 7.475, 7.475, 7.475, 7.475, 7.475, 7.588, 7.588, 7.588, 7.588, 7.713, 7.713, 7.713, 7.713, 7.938, 7.938, 7.938, 8.025, 8.025, 8.025, 8.025, 8.025, 8.35, 8.35, 8.35, 8.35, 8.35, 8.35, 8.35, 8.35, 8.838, 8.838, 8.838, 8.838, 8.838, 8.838, 9.6, 9.725, 9.725, 9.725, 9.725, 9.725, 9.725, 9.875, 9.875, 9.875, 9.875, 9.875, 9.875, 9.875, 10.213, 10.213, 10